Body:
Hey @christianherweg0807 You have an issue with your config, the docs says its overridden by `provider.npm`, which means like `<model_id>.provider.npm`

So what you should have is

```json
{
  "provider": {
    "litellm": {
      "npm": "@ai-sdk/anthropic",
      "options": {
        "baseURL": "https://litellm.example.com/v1",
        "apiKey": "{env:LITELLM_VIRTUAL_KEY}"
      },
      "models": {
        "claude-sonnet-4-6": {
          "name": "Claude Sonnet 4.6"
        },
        "azure/gpt-4-1": {
          "provider": {
            "npm": "@ai-sdk/openai-compatible",
           },
          "name": "GPT-4.1"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Try this and should work. If it does please go ahead and close the issue!

```json
{
  "plugin": [],
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "provider": {
    "zai-coding-plan":{
      "models": {
        "glm-5.2": {
          "name": "GLM 5.2",
          "limit": {
            "context": 1000000,
            "output": 131072
          },
          "options": {
            "reasoningEffort": "max"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

@rekram1-node @thdxr 

Hey maintainers, quite a few people and projects have run into the need for this Go usage endpoint (see reactions/linked issues). 

Would be great to get eyes on it when you have a chance. Thanks for the awesome project! 🙏
